{"availability":"available","full":"aurorascharff/next16-commerce","name":"next16-commerce","description":"A performant e-commerce demo with Cache Components and Server/Client composition patterns using Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind CSS and Prisma.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":265,"forks":53,"created":"2025-05-29T20:12:56Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:02:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next16-commerce.vercel.app","topics":["app-router","cache-components","nextjs","react19","rsc","tailwindcss","tailwindcss-v4"],"demo":"https://next16-commerce.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.205Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.205Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.205Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.205Z","stars":265,"forks":53}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A commerce demo for exploring Cache Components, Partial Prefetching, and static guarantees in Next.js.","This repository started as the demo for my talk, Composition, Caching, and Architecture in Modern Next.js. Since then, the current app has moved to the latest Next.js canary and follows the architecture from the Next.js App Architecture skill and Component Architecture for React Server Components."],"features":["Cache Components mix static, cached, and request-time content in the same route. Shared product data uses 'use cache', while cookie-backed cart and saved state use 'use cache: private'.","Partial Prefetching prefetches the shared route shell. Product links use prefetch={true} so cached product details are available before navigation, while personalized state waits for the visit.","ensureStatic guarantees static output at the stage a route needs it. The store layout guarantees its shell, product routes guarantee each prefetch, and the About page guarantees a full navigation.","Server Functions update the cart, saved products, account details, and featured products on the server, then invalidate only the cache tags they change with updateTag.","React Compiler memoizes components and hooks automatically, so the code needs no manual useMemo or useCallback."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-commerce/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d923fa67137640d37bd73f277e61b73ec4580a104a880d2b01bd2415187965eb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.294Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.294Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A commerce demo for exploring Cache Components, Partial Prefetching, and static guarantees in Next.js.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-commerce/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d923fa67137640d37bd73f277e61b73ec4580a104a880d2b01bd2415187965eb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-commerce/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.295Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T16:02:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-commerce/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:42.296Z","hash":"d923fa67137640d37bd73f277e61b73ec4580a104a880d2b01bd2415187965eb","originalBytes":4900,"storedBytes":4900,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pnpm","run","cache","next.js","static","bash","components","product","react","server","app","architecture","database","demo","guarantees","personalized","route","cart","partial","playwright","prefetching","prisma","sqlite","state","before","cached","canary","change","code","commerce","compiler","content","current","details","during","end-to-end","ensurestatic","env.local","exec","functions","generate","license","main","needs","next","next.js.","postgresql","prefetch","prefetches","prisma.push","prisma.seed","products","routes","saved","shared","shell","started","suspense","talk","tests","transitions","url","useoptimistic","view","while","about","accessible","account","across","add","animat